body:
@silverhook - thanks for the analysis which I would agree with.

I'm also a bit concerned that the intentions of the license would be extremely hard to enforce.  If someone were to use the code it in the ways the license was intended to prevent and that challenge that in court, there are holes you could drive a truck through without thinking very hard. 

While this is not explicitly one of our inclusion principles, it is something we have discussed from time to time. I'm not sure SPDX wants to "endorse" by adding to the SPDX License List something that 1) is not able to reach the goals that it intends - that feels like a disservice for people who use the license and feel strongly about the position it is trying to take; and 2) has glaring legal drafting issues
